  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.11.2\n* Dependency Fix: Drop incorrect System.Drawing reference\n\nVersion 2.11.1\n* Security Fix: Insufficient Validation of LogoutRequests\n* Security Fix: Missing HTML Output Encoding\n* Security Fix: Incorrect RelayState Integrity Validation\n* Security Fix: Denial of Service caused by Missing Input Validation\n\nVersion 2.11.0\n* Support RSA-OAEP for encrypted XML with specified mask generation function\n* Built in support for AES-GCM (.NET 8 target only)\n* Dropped .NET Standard 2.1 target in favour of .NET 8.\n\nSee GitHub milestone issue list for details.",
